92
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,000
Where were you at the time?

93
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:12,000
I was up in the Yukon Arctic, so basically far north, far northwestern Canada.

94
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:22,000
So you have, like this moment- I don't know exactly how to describe this moment- a moment of enlightenment or clarity or some kind of transcendent moment.

95
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Can you share that with us? Can you explain what happened?

96
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:35,000
Yeah, I still struggle to explain it, to be honest, but basically I've been so worn down by what I was going through

97
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:43,000
And at the time I was in the middle of a 657 mile 24 day stretch, without crossing the road and without seeing a human being,

98
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:51,000
And I was just getting beat up on a regular basis by big floods and bears and mosquitoes,

99
00:09:51,000 --> 00:10:01,000
And I was just so worn down by those elements. in addition to just this larger sense of exposure and risk and self dependence,

100
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:18,000
When I came up on a porcupine migration trail corridor, which is this very visible track across the tundra, I just broke down and realized- or not realized, but felt like I was tapping into their energy

101
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:29,000
And I knew that this is a species that, for their survival, has this journey plus a year, where they migrate back and forth from their wintering grounds to their migrating grounds,

102
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:35,000
And when they're on that journey, they are just basically eating, sleeping and moving.

103
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:44,000
And for me it was the same thing, And I had this sort of connection with the caribou, where I was just one of them.

104
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:54,000
I stopped being some elevated species, I was just another animal, first in this landscape that was having the same experience: that they were looking over my shoulder.

105
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:59,000
I was trying to send myself off from those variables that I listed before.

106
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:19,000
It was a pretty amazing moment, and definitely never something that had happened before and not something that would have been possible if I hadn't really- almost only intentionally- worn myself down and just wasn't unable to keep my guard up to have that experience.

