00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,000
And it's been that way for 100 years now.

121
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:32,000
For long as I've been involved in Scouting- no doubt as long as you've been involved- there's always been a lot of discussions that tend to turn into arguments about what constitutes an Eagle Scout.

122
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Yeah,

123
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:42,000
People can get pretty exercised about it. You've had an interesting perspective of that question. Is there an answer?

124
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:49,000
There's simple answers and there's complicated answers. The simple answer is being an Eagle Scouts state of mind.

125
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:54,000
One of the amazing things about the Eagle Award is it's the only award of childhood that stays with you your entire life.

126
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:58,000
You go in the military. you can wear your Eagle Medal- a special version of it-

