00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:04,000
When you're 90 years old and you die, your paper in your obituary is likely to mention the fact that you were an Eagle Scout.

128
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,000
It's not going to mention you were varsity football or anything else you did as a kid.

129
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:16,000
It's attached to your entire life and to be cognizant of that fact and to live up to it is to be a true Eagle Scout.

130
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,000
That's the simple answer. There's a more complicated answer.

131
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:30,000
You've dealt with it a lot in your blog. A lot of the people writing in commenting, especially people asking for advice. a lot of people write in and say:

