00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:22,000
Or that you just were unaware of and you thought was something pretty incredible.

151
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:29,000
I think the thing that struck me the most was that Eagle scouting stands apart from Boy Scouting.

152
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:35,000
It's one of those. it's a classic example of being, of scouting, but not necessarily part of scouting.

153
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Once you start on the trail to Eagle beginning, when you become a life, you enter into a different reality

154
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:49,000
and you move down that path, And that path has been taken now for a hundred years by you know

155
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:54,000
what- six million, five to six million boys ahead of you,

156
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:59,000
And it's a fraternity And it's filled with like-minded people,

157
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:05,000
All of whom have decided that they're going to go for something that's bigger than anything they've ever done in their lives

158
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:09,000
And that's going to challenge them in ways they can't imagine.

159
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:16,000
And I was struck by that continuity, That Eagle scouting really is a thing unto itself

160
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:21,000
When you have this group of people that are these kind of overachievers

161
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:28,000
and who did something this big at such a young age. they're going to cut their own path for the rest of their lives,

162
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:33,000
So you can't control them. Former members who are still officially members,

163
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:38,000
who are presidents of universities and Nobel Prize winners and Medal of Honor awardees

164
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:43,000
and members of Congress- they're a heck of a lot more powerful than scouting itself

165
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:48,000
And I love that about it. And when you go to an Eagle Court of Honor

166
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:52,000
and they form the Eagle Court and inviting everybody from the audience to come up

167
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:56,000
see these guys of all ages, from their 20s to their 80s,

