00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:01,000
And you know it's colored their entire lives. Everywhere you go you're going to run into an Eagle Scout

169
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:05,000
and he's going to be the guy who's in the position of greatest responsibility.

170
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:09,000
And that's an amazing thing, It's a powerful thing.

171
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:16,000
And writing the book, I felt enormous pride in this fraternity that I was part of

172
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:22,000
and felt compelled even more to be an Eagle Scout, to act like an Eagle Scout

